<title>USA: Century Communications Corp Q3 loss.</title>
<headline>Century Communications Corp Q3 loss.</headline>
<dateline>NEW CANAAN, Conn. 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.33     loss	 $0.33</p>
<p> Net loss		  23,368     loss	23,623</p>
<p> Revs		     160,965		  122,054</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,383		   73,807</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended Feb 28 vs Feb 29.  </p>
<p>	  9  MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $1.42     loss	 $0.95</p>
<p> Net loss		 101,837     loss	66,688</p>
<p> Revs		     472,965		  359,720</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,196		   73,689</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Periods ended Feb 28 vs Feb 29.</p>
<p>Q3 operating income before depreciation and amortization and Australian operations: $82.1 million vs $63.2 million.</p>
<p>Nine month operating income before depreciation and amortization and Australian operations: $253.1 million vs $190.2 million.</p>
<p>Century Communications owns 31.8 percent of Centennial Cellular Corp.</p>
